subckt Main (VDD VSS Vout Vin)
C1 (net5 VSS) capacitor c=1p
C2 (net4 Vin) capacitor c=1p
C3 (Vout net7) capacitor c=1p
L1 (net6 net1) inductor l=1n
L2 (net2 VSS) inductor l=1n
L3 (VDD net7) inductor l=1n
L4 (net4 net3) inductor l=1n
M1 (net1 net3 net2 VSS) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M2 (net7 net5 net6 VSS) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
R1 (net5 VDD) resistor r=1k
R2 (net0 net3) resistor r=1k
V1 (net0 VSS) vsource dc=1.8
